WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.869
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:03.670
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.537
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.304
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.607
Yesterday was Election Day

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.008
and "Late Night"
is now projecting

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.678
the Democrats will pick up
at least one seat

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.912
at Thanksgiving dinner.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:14.747
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.883
In an interview last night
with NBC News,

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.751
South Carolina
Senator Lindsey Graham said,

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.553
"Hats off to the Democrats

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.355
for performing well
in swing districts."

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.991
Oh, yeah, hats way off!

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.692
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.728
Democratic Senator
Raphael Warnock

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.963
and Republican challenger
Herschel Walker

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:33.399
are set to head to a runoff
on December 6th

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:35.435
to decide Georgia's Senate race.

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.871
And, if you think Georgia's
election process is confusing,

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:42.475
imagine trying to explain it
to Herschel Walker.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.377
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.612
Pennsylvania Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman

00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:49.481
defeated Republican candidate
Dr. Mehmet Oz yesterday...

00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:50.917
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.385
...in the state Senate race.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:55.321
Oz says he's just happy
he doesn't have to pretend

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.457
to root for the
Philadelphia Steelers anymore.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.358
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:03.029
Democrat Maxwell Frost yesterday
became the first member

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.732
of Generation Z elected
to Congress,

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.967
while Chuck Grassley recorded
another win

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.369
for Generation Zzz!

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:11.237
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.472
[ Mumbling ]

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.973
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.609
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
was booed this week at the

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.445
Houston Astros World Series
Championship Parade.

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:21.513
As well as the bank,
the grocery store,

00:01:21.513 --> 00:01:22.415
[ Laughter ]
his office,

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.049
[ Applause ]
and at his house.

00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:27.052
All in all, a pretty average
week for Ted Cruz.

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:30.623
[ Laughter and applause ]
President Biden and former
President Barack Obama

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:32.491
posted a video
on Twitter this week

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:33.826
[ Laughter ]
reminding people to vote.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.529
You know, it's nice to see
they're still friends.

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:39.699
The only way we're getting video
of Trump and Pence together is

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:41.567 line:0%
if Maury springs it on them.

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.537 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.241
Maryland yesterday became
the 20th state

00:01:49.241 --> 00:01:50.409
to legalize marijuana,

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:52.112
which means that,
for the first time ever,

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.913
there's something to do
in Maryland.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.915
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:59.185
Former President Trump voted
in yesterday's midterm elections

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.321
in Florida, then,
because he can't help himself,

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.923
took a bunch of ballots back
to Mar-A-Lago.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.658
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.193
And, finally, a Brooklyn man

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.095
who was on the run
from fraud charges

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.763
was arrested recently in Florida

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.967
after the federal agent
who signed his arrest warrant

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.969
spotted him
at a Disney theme park.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.104
[ Laughter ]
Huh!

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:19.371
It's a small world.

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:23.743
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:27.847
Always. end. with. a dad joke.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.516
[ Laughter ]
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:32.752
Wow! We got a great show
for you tonight.

